","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_42","text":"The flowers in the garden seemed to enjoy themselves while I was gone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_43","text":"You all did a wonderful job. They're even more animated than usual.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona_no","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_44","text":"Really? That's good to hear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona_no","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_45","text":"Oh, did you find any Aurora Bloom, by the way?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_46","text":"We certainly did! Thanks to Sunflower and Blossom, we were able to bring back some safe and sound.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_47","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_47","text":"Flora shows Nero and Leona the Aurora Blooms she collected from the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona_no","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_48","text":"Wow, what a pretty flower.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_49","text":"I've never seen a flower like that before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona_no","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_50","text":"Are you going to plant it in the garden and give it another shot?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_51","text":"No, I'm going to harvest the seeds and plant them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_52","text":"I only managed to bring back a couple of flowers,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_intermission_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_intermission_01_53","text":"so it would be difficult to defend their value as is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{